{
  "version": 1,
  "document": {
    "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/highlight.test.ts",
    "title": "代码高亮行为测试",
    "summary": "验证 TypeScript 多行语法状态、按行拆分结果以及已知和未知语言下的 HTML 转义安全性；尚未覆盖全部语言别名、并发加载和复杂嵌套标签。",
    "category": "tests",
    "sections": [
      {
        "key": "tested-behavior",
        "title": "断言覆盖的行为",
        "body": "测试先把包含跨行注释与 TypeScript 声明的源码交给 `highlightCode`，再用 `highlightedLines` 拆成编号行；它断言结果正好有三行，第二行仍处于注释样式，第三行能识别关键字。这证明拆行没有丢失跨行 lexer 样式状态，并覆盖了高亮与逐行展示的组合路径。[[c1]]\n\n另一用例分别传入 `ts` 和未知语言，并以形似 `<img onerror>` 的文本检查输出：两条路径都不得保留真实 `<img` 标签，且必须出现转义后的尖括号。因此测试同时约束了 highlight.js 已知语言输出和未知语言降级分支的基本注入防护。[[c2]]"
      },
      {
        "key": "coverage-boundary",
        "title": "覆盖边界",
        "body": "这些断言关注结果片段而非完整 HTML，因此允许高亮库调整无关的标签结构；但它没有验证空输入、大小写语言名、所有别名、XML 所需的多语言加载、并发注册，或不平衡 span 输入的拆行行为。测试也没有挂载真实代码查看器，不能证明行号、复制、滚动或 CSS 主题在浏览器中的表现。当前证据仅能支持两个独立测试用例所列的行为边界。[[c3]]"
      }
    ],
    "citations": [
      {
        "key": "c1",
        "label": "跨行注释与关键字测试",
        "reason": "支持多行注释状态在拆行为编号行后仍被保留，以及 TypeScript 关键字被识别的论断。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/highlight.test.ts",
          "startLine": 4,
          "endLine": 9
        },
        "quote": "it(\"highlights TypeScript and preserves multiline comments in numbered rows\", async () => {\n  const lines = highlightedLines(await highlightCode(\"/* start\\ncontinued */\\nexport const value = 1;\", \"ts\"));\n  expect(lines).toHaveLength(3);\n  expect(lines[1]).toContain('<span class=\"hljs-comment\">continued */</span>');\n  e"
      },
      {
        "key": "c2",
        "label": "已知与未知语言转义测试",
        "reason": "支持两类语言输入都不会把恶意标记作为真实 HTML 输出的安全断言。",
        "relation": "supports",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/highlight.test.ts",
          "startLine": 11,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "it(\"escapes markup for known and unknown languages\", async () => {\n  for (const language of [\"ts\", \"unknown\"]) {\n    const html = await highlightCode('<img src=x onerror=\"alert(1)\">', language);\n    expect(html).not.toContain(\"<img\");\n    expect(html).toContain(\"&lt;\");\n  }\n});"
      },
      {
        "key": "c3",
        "label": "当前测试文件范围",
        "reason": "用完整测试范围说明现有材料只包含两个用例，从而界定尚未覆盖的行为。",
        "relation": "explains",
        "target": {
          "kind": "material",
          "key": "omem:packages/ui/src/highlight.test.ts",
          "startLine": 1,
          "endLine": 17
        },
        "quote": "import { expect, it } from \"vitest\";\nimport { highlightCode, highlightedLines } from \"./highlight\";\n\nit(\"highlights TypeScript and preserves multiline comments in numbered rows\", async () => {\n  const lines = highlightedLines(await highlightCode(\"/* start\\ncontinued */\\nexport const value = 1;\", \"ts\"));\n  expect(lines)"
      }
    ],
